From de0d09a6c743677034f88e3f2a9bbfedc07d4194 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:52:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build: use ThinLTO and skip the strict defconfig check
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Full LTO does not fit in the 12 GiB build VM, so build with ThinLTO;
the KMI is unchanged.

Each feature patch below places its own gki_defconfig options after a
stock anchor line of its own instead of in savedefconfig order, so drop
check_defconfig from POST_DEFCONFIG_CMDS.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

Origin: 本地原创（build/ThinLTO 设置）
Upstream-Status: Not-Applicable
KABI: none
Depends-On: none
Notes: 关闭 build.config.gki 的 check_defconfig；后续每个功能补丁把选项放在自己的原厂锚点行之后，互不依赖
Tested-On: yudi 5.10.272, 2026-10-29
---
 arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig | 2 +-
 build.config.gki                 | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
index 3bed8f86b..f8205546c 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
@@ -94,7 +94,7 @@ CONFIG_CRYPTO_AES_ARM64_CE_BLK=y
 CONFIG_KPROBES=y
 CONFIG_JUMP_LABEL=y
 CONFIG_SHADOW_CALL_STACK=y
-CONFIG_LTO_CLANG_FULL=y
+CONFIG_LTO_CLANG_THIN=y
 CONFIG_CFI_CLANG=y
 CONFIG_MODULES=y
 CONFIG_MODULE_UNLOAD=y
diff --git a/build.config.gki b/build.config.gki
index 44d4ed1be..d5c778536 100644
--- a/build.config.gki
+++ b/build.config.gki
@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@
 DEFCONFIG=gki_defconfig
-POST_DEFCONFIG_CMDS="check_defconfig"
+POST_DEFCONFIG_CMDS=""
 
-- 
2.43.0

